[2026-03-15T03:21:30.007Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X2o7nwDQNvcXVsnhjaTZuD","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the Airbnb Clone application. Let me create a detailed summary of my findings.\n\n## Comprehensive Airbnb Clone Application Analysis\n\nI've thoroughly explored the `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src` directory and backend functions. Here's a complete breakdown:\n\n### 1. **FULL FILE STRUCTURE**\n\n```\n/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/\n├── App.tsx (main routing)\n├── main.tsx (entry point)\n├── store.ts (Redux store setup)\n├── index.css (Tailwind CSS with custom theme)\n├── pages/\n│   ├── Home.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyDetail.tsx\n│   ├── MyTrips.tsx\n│   ├── HostDashboard.tsx\n│   ├── Profile.tsx\n│   ├── Login.tsx\n│   └── WriteReview.tsx\n├── components/\n│   ├── Sidebar.tsx\n│   ├── SearchBar.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyCard.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyGrid.tsx\n│   ├── CategoryFilter.tsx\n│   ├── FiltersPanel.tsx\n│   ├── ImageGallery.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyHeader.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyInfo.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyDescription.tsx\n│   ├── AmenitiesList.tsx\n│   ├── BookingCard.tsx\n│   ├── ReviewsSection.tsx\n│   ├── HostInfoCard.tsx\n│   ├── LoginForm.tsx\n│   ├── RegisterForm.tsx\n│   ├── ProfileForm.tsx\n│   ├── AuthToggle.tsx\n│   ├── FavoriteButton.tsx\n│   ├── Pagination.tsx\n│   ├── TripsTabs.tsx\n│   ├── TripCard.tsx\n│   ├── CancelBookingDialog.tsx\n│   ├── ListingsTab.tsx\n│   ├── BookingsTab.tsx\n│   ├── AddListingForm.tsx\n│   ├── ReviewForm.tsx\n│   ├── RatingSliders.tsx\n│   ├── UserReviewsList.tsx\n│   ├── BecomeHostButton.tsx\n│   ├── StatsOverview.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyBookingContext.tsx (context for booking state)\n│   └── Pagination.tsx\n└── slices/\n    ├── authSlice.ts\n    ├── propertiesSlice.ts\n    ├── favoritesSlice.ts\n    ├── amenitiesSlice.ts\n    ├── propertyDetailSlice.ts\n    ├── bookingsSlice.ts\n    ├── hostSlice.ts\n    ├── userReviewsSlice.ts\n    └── reviewFormSlice.ts\n```\n\n### 2. **MAIN HOME PAGE COMPONENT**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx`\n\nThis is the main listing page that displays property cards. It:\n- Uses Redux to fetch properties with filters (`fetchProperties` from `propertiesSlice`)\n- Displays search bar for location/dates/guests\n- Shows category filter for property types (Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse)\n- Has a filters panel for price range, rooms/beds/bathrooms, and amenities\n- Renders a `PropertyGrid` component showing multiple `PropertyCard` components\n- Supports pagination\n\n### 3. **LISTING DETAIL PAGE COMPONENT**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/PropertyDetail.tsx`\n\nDisplays full property details with:\n- Back button navigation\n- `ImageGallery` (main image + thumbnails)\n- `PropertyHeader` (title, location, ratings, host info)\n- `PropertyInfo` (property type, guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, check-in/out times)\n- `PropertyDescription`\n- `AmenitiesList`\n- `ReviewsSection` (displays guest reviews with ratings)\n- `HostInfoCard`\n- **`BookingCard`** - the date picker and booking form (right sidebar)\n\n### 4. **SEARCH FUNCTIONALITY**\n\n**SearchBar Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/SearchBar.tsx`\n\nSearches by:\n- **City/Location** (text input, case-insensitive partial match via LIKE)\n- **Check-in Date** (date picker, minimum today)\n- **Check-out Date** (date picker, minimum check-in + 1 day)\n- **Number of Guests** (numeric input)\n\n**Backend Search Logic:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/properties.ts` (lines 51-141)\n\nThe search filters applied to the database query:\n1. **City filter**: `LOWER(p.city) LIKE LOWER('%' || ${city} || '%')`\n2. **Guests filter**: `p.max_guests >= ${guestsNum}`\n3. **Property type**: Exact match on `property_type`\n4. **Price range**: `p.price_per_night >= ${minPrice}` and `<= ${maxPrice}`\n5. **Room/bed/bathroom counts**: `>=` comparisons\n6. **Date availability**: Checks for NO overlapping bookings with status 'confirmed' or 'pending'\n   - Booking overlap detection: `b.check_in < ${checkOut} AND b.check_out > ${checkIn}`\n7. **Amenities**: Requires matching ALL selected amenity IDs\n\n**Pagination:** 12 properties per page (limit=12)\n\n### 5. **DATE PICKER / BOOKING CARD COMPONENT**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingCard.tsx`\n\nThis is the date picker and reservation form on the property detail page:\n- **Check-in input**: HTML `<input type=\"date\">` with min=today\n- **Check-out input**: HTML `<input type=\"date\">` with min=check-in or today\n- **Guests selector**: `<select>` dropdown (1 to property.max_guests)\n- **Price calculation**:\n  - Nights calculation: `Math.round((new Date(checkOut) - new Date(checkIn)) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24))`\n  - Nightly total: `nights * property.price_per_night`\n  - Cleaning fee: `property.cleaning_fee`\n  - Total: `nightlyTotal + cleaningFee`\n- **Reserve button**: Dispatches `createBooking` thunk, redirects to `/trips`\n- Prevents booking own property\n- Shows login prompt if not authenticated\n\n### 6. **BOOKING/AVAILABILITY DATA MODELS**\n\n**Booking Interface** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\ninterface Booking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string       // ISO date string\n  check_out: string      // ISO date string\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string\n  property_city?: string\n  property_country?: string\n  property_image?: string | null\n  has_review?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n**Availability Check**: Backend does real-time overlap checking (lines 31-40 of `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`):\n```sql\nSELECT id FROM bookings\nWHERE property_id = ${property_id}\nAND status IN ('confirmed', 'pending')\nAND check_in < ${check_out}\nAND check_out > ${check_in}\n```\n\n**Property Model** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertiesSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\ninterface Property {\n  id: string\n  host_id: string\n  title: string\n  description: string\n  property_type: string\n  price_per_night: number\n  cleaning_fee: number\n  max_guests: number\n  bedrooms: number\n  beds: number\n  bathrooms: number\n  address: string\n  city: string\n  state: string | null\n  country: string\n  latitude: number | null\n  longitude: number | null\n  check_in_time: string    // \"14:00\" format\n  check_out_time: string   // \"10:00\" format\n  is_active: boolean\n  created_at: string\n  updated_at: string\n  main_image?: string | null\n  avg_rating?: number\n  review_count?: number\n  // Detail fields\n  host_name?: string\n  host_avatar?: string | null\n  host_bio?: string | null\n  host_since?: string\n  host_listing_count?: number\n  images?: PropertyImage[]\n  amenities?: Amenity[]\n  reviews?: Review[]\n}\n```\n\n### 7. **HEADER/NAVIGATION WITH SEARCH BAR**\n\n**Sidebar Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`\n\nNavigation sidebar (220px wide, collapses to 60px):\n- **Logo**: \"airbnb\" in primary red color\n- **Navigation items** (conditionally shown):\n  - Home (always shown)\n  - My Trips (always shown)\n  - Hosting (only if `is_host === true`)\n  - Profile (always shown)\n- **Logout button** (bottom)\n- Active link highlighting with primary color\n- Collapse/expand toggle button\n\nThe SearchBar is part of the Home page layout, not in the header - it's rendered at the top of the home page content area.\n\n### 8. **REDUX STORE STRUCTURE**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts`\n\nStore configuration with slices:\n```typescript\n{\n  auth: authSlice              // Current user, login/register/update\n  properties: propertiesSlice  // List of properties with filters & pagination\n  favorites: favoritesSlice    // User's favorite property IDs\n  amenities: amenitiesSlice    // Available amenities list\n  propertyDetail: propertyDetailSlice  // Single property details\n  bookings: bookingsSlice      // User's bookings (as guest)\n  host: hostSlice              // Host's listings, bookings, stats\n  userReviews: userReviewsSlice  // Guest's submitted reviews\n  reviewForm: reviewFormSlice   // Review form state for WriteReview page\n}\n```\n\n### 9. **API/BACKEND FUNCTIONS - SEARCH & BOOKINGS**\n\n**Backend Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Key Functions:**\n\n1. **properties.ts** - Property search and detail\n   - `GET /api/properties` - Search with filters (city, dates, guests, price, rooms, amenities)\n   - `GET /api/properties/:id` - Get single property with images, amenities, reviews, host info\n   - `POST /api/properties` - Create property (host)\n   - `PUT /api/properties/:id` - Update property\n   - `DELETE /api/properties/:id` - Deactivate property\n\n2. **bookings.ts** - Booking management\n   - `POST /api/bookings` - Create booking (checks availability overlap)\n   - `GET /api/bookings?guest_id=` - Get user's bookings\n   - `PUT /api/bookings/:id` - Update booking status\n   - `DELETE /api/bookings/:id` - Delete single booking\n   - `DELETE /api/bookings` - Reset all bookings to seed data\n\n3. **auth.ts** - User authentication\n   - `POST /api/auth` - Login (email only) or Register (email + name)\n\n4. **reviews.ts** - Review management\n   - `GET /api/reviews?guest_id=` - Get reviews submitted by user\n   - `GET /api/reviews?property_id=` - Get reviews for property\n   - `POST /api/reviews` - Submit review (includes: rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value, comment)\n   - `DELETE /api/reviews/:id` - Delete review\n\n5. **amenities.ts** - Amenities list\n   - `GET /api/amenities` - Get all amenities grouped by category\n\n6. **favorites.ts** - Favorites management\n   - `GET /api/favorites?user_id=` - Get user's favorites\n   - `POST /api/favorites` - Add favorite\n   - `DELETE /api/favorites/:propertyId?user_id=` - Remove favorite\n\n7. **users.ts** - User management\n   - `GET /api/users/:id` - Get user profile\n   - `PUT /api/users/:id` - Update user profile\n   - `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` - Become a host\n   - `POST /api/users/:id/reset-host` - Reset host status\n\n8. **host-stats.ts** - Host statistics\n   - `GET /api/host-stats?host_id=` - Get total listings, active bookings, total earnings, average rating, review count\n\n9. **host-listings.ts** - Host's properties\n10. **host-bookings.ts** - Host's incoming bookings\n11. **property-images.ts** - Property image management\n\n### 10. **OVERALL STYLING APPROACH**\n\n**Styling Method:** Tailwind CSS with custom theme variables\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css`\n\nUses:\n- **Tailwind CSS** (`@import \"tailwindcss\"`)\n- **CSS custom properties (variables)** for theming:\n  - `--color-primary: #FF5A5F` (Airbnb red)\n  - `--color-primary-dark: #E04E52`\n  - `--color-primary-light: #FF787C`\n  - `--color-bg: #FFFFFF`\n  - `--color-bg-secondary: #F7F7F7`\n  - `--color-text: #222222`\n  - `--color-text-secondary: #717171`\n  - `--color-border: #DDDDDD`\n  - Status colors: pending, confirmed, cancelled, completed\n\n**Component Styling:** All components use Tailwind utility classes with class name strings like:\n```tsx\nclassName=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors\"\n```\n\n**Layout:**\n- Flexbox-based layouts\n- Grid for property listings (responsive: 1 col mobile, 2 sm, 3 lg, 4 xl)\n- Sticky positioning for sidebars and booking cards\n- Responsive design with Tailwind breakpoints (max-sm, md, lg, xl)\n\n### 11. **REDUX THUNKS - ASYNC OPERATIONS**\n\nKey Redux async thunks:\n- `propertiesSlice.fetchProperties()` - Search/fetch properties with filters\n- `propertyDetailSlice.fetchPropertyDetail()` - Get single property\n- `bookingsSlice.createBooking()` - Create a booking\n- `bookingsSlice.fetchUserBookings()` - Get user's bookings\n- `bookingsSlice.cancelBooking()` - Cancel a booking\n- `favoritesSlice.fetchFavorites()`, `addFavorite()`, `removeFavorite()`\n- `amenitiesSlice.fetchAmenities()` - Get amenities list\n- `authSlice.loginUser()`, `registerUser()`, `updateUser()`, `becomeHost()`\n- `hostSlice.fetchHostStats()`, `fetchHostListings()`, `fetchHostBookings()`\n- `userReviewsSlice.fetchUserReviews()`\n- `reviewFormSlice.fetchBookingForReview()`, `submitReview()`\n\n### 12. **KEY COMPONENT INTERACTIONS**\n\n- **Home page** → Search → Filters properties via Redux → Updates URL params → Displays PropertyGrid\n- **PropertyCard** → Click → Navigate to `/properties/:id`\n- **PropertyDetail** → BookingCard → Select dates → Reserve → Create booking → Redirect to `/trips`\n- **MyTrips** → Shows user's bookings (pending, confirmed, completed, cancelled tabs)\n- **HostDashboard** → Shows host stats, listings, and incoming bookings\n- **WriteReview** → Submit review with 5 rating categories + overall comment\n\n### 13. **DATA FLOW SUMMARY**\n\n1. **Search**: User enters filters in SearchBar → `setFilters()` → Redux fetches properties → PropertyGrid renders cards\n2. **Booking**: User selects dates in BookingCard → `createBooking()` thunk → Backend checks availability → Creates booking → Redirects to trips\n3. **Reviews**: Completed booking → Can write review → `submitReview()` thunk → Stored in database → Displayed on property detail\n4. **Host Management**: Host can create listings, manage bookings, view stats, activate/deactivate properties\n\nAll files are located in:\n- Frontend: `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/`\n- Backend: `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a0ba6f12d3117c8c0 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 76391\ntool_uses: 40\nduration_ms: 58425</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d3ea4c5-1166-4389-879f-ac502e987c77","uuid":"c8733ba6-29a7-4b9f-91cf-9acc2be14d15","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Thoroughly explore the /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src directory. I need to understand:\n\n1. The full file structure (all components, pages, store slices, etc.)\n2. The main page/home page component that shows listing cards\n3. The listing detail page component\n4. The search functionality (how search works, what fields it searches)\n5. The date picker component on the listing detail page\n6. Any booking/availability data models\n7. The header/navigation component with search bar\n8. The Redux store structure\n9. Any API/backend functions related to search and bookings\n10. The overall styling approach (CSS modules, tailwind, styled-components, etc.)\n\nAlso check /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/ for backend functions.\n\nRead all key component files fully so you can report their complete content structure.","agentId":"a0ba6f12d3117c8c0","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the Airbnb Clone application. Let me create a detailed summary of my findings.\n\n## Comprehensive Airbnb Clone Application Analysis\n\nI've thoroughly explored the `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src` directory and backend functions. Here's a complete breakdown:\n\n### 1. **FULL FILE STRUCTURE**\n\n```\n/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/\n├── App.tsx (main routing)\n├── main.tsx (entry point)\n├── store.ts (Redux store setup)\n├── index.css (Tailwind CSS with custom theme)\n├── pages/\n│   ├── Home.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyDetail.tsx\n│   ├── MyTrips.tsx\n│   ├── HostDashboard.tsx\n│   ├── Profile.tsx\n│   ├── Login.tsx\n│   └── WriteReview.tsx\n├── components/\n│   ├── Sidebar.tsx\n│   ├── SearchBar.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyCard.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyGrid.tsx\n│   ├── CategoryFilter.tsx\n│   ├── FiltersPanel.tsx\n│   ├── ImageGallery.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyHeader.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyInfo.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyDescription.tsx\n│   ├── AmenitiesList.tsx\n│   ├── BookingCard.tsx\n│   ├── ReviewsSection.tsx\n│   ├── HostInfoCard.tsx\n│   ├── LoginForm.tsx\n│   ├── RegisterForm.tsx\n│   ├── ProfileForm.tsx\n│   ├── AuthToggle.tsx\n│   ├── FavoriteButton.tsx\n│   ├── Pagination.tsx\n│   ├── TripsTabs.tsx\n│   ├── TripCard.tsx\n│   ├── CancelBookingDialog.tsx\n│   ├── ListingsTab.tsx\n│   ├── BookingsTab.tsx\n│   ├── AddListingForm.tsx\n│   ├── ReviewForm.tsx\n│   ├── RatingSliders.tsx\n│   ├── UserReviewsList.tsx\n│   ├── BecomeHostButton.tsx\n│   ├── StatsOverview.tsx\n│   ├── PropertyBookingContext.tsx (context for booking state)\n│   └── Pagination.tsx\n└── slices/\n    ├── authSlice.ts\n    ├── propertiesSlice.ts\n    ├── favoritesSlice.ts\n    ├── amenitiesSlice.ts\n    ├── propertyDetailSlice.ts\n    ├── bookingsSlice.ts\n    ├── hostSlice.ts\n    ├── userReviewsSlice.ts\n    └── reviewFormSlice.ts\n```\n\n### 2. **MAIN HOME PAGE COMPONENT**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx`\n\nThis is the main listing page that displays property cards. It:\n- Uses Redux to fetch properties with filters (`fetchProperties` from `propertiesSlice`)\n- Displays search bar for location/dates/guests\n- Shows category filter for property types (Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse)\n- Has a filters panel for price range, rooms/beds/bathrooms, and amenities\n- Renders a `PropertyGrid` component showing multiple `PropertyCard` components\n- Supports pagination\n\n### 3. **LISTING DETAIL PAGE COMPONENT**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/PropertyDetail.tsx`\n\nDisplays full property details with:\n- Back button navigation\n- `ImageGallery` (main image + thumbnails)\n- `PropertyHeader` (title, location, ratings, host info)\n- `PropertyInfo` (property type, guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, check-in/out times)\n- `PropertyDescription`\n- `AmenitiesList`\n- `ReviewsSection` (displays guest reviews with ratings)\n- `HostInfoCard`\n- **`BookingCard`** - the date picker and booking form (right sidebar)\n\n### 4. **SEARCH FUNCTIONALITY**\n\n**SearchBar Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/SearchBar.tsx`\n\nSearches by:\n- **City/Location** (text input, case-insensitive partial match via LIKE)\n- **Check-in Date** (date picker, minimum today)\n- **Check-out Date** (date picker, minimum check-in + 1 day)\n- **Number of Guests** (numeric input)\n\n**Backend Search Logic:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/properties.ts` (lines 51-141)\n\nThe search filters applied to the database query:\n1. **City filter**: `LOWER(p.city) LIKE LOWER('%' || ${city} || '%')`\n2. **Guests filter**: `p.max_guests >= ${guestsNum}`\n3. **Property type**: Exact match on `property_type`\n4. **Price range**: `p.price_per_night >= ${minPrice}` and `<= ${maxPrice}`\n5. **Room/bed/bathroom counts**: `>=` comparisons\n6. **Date availability**: Checks for NO overlapping bookings with status 'confirmed' or 'pending'\n   - Booking overlap detection: `b.check_in < ${checkOut} AND b.check_out > ${checkIn}`\n7. **Amenities**: Requires matching ALL selected amenity IDs\n\n**Pagination:** 12 properties per page (limit=12)\n\n### 5. **DATE PICKER / BOOKING CARD COMPONENT**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingCard.tsx`\n\nThis is the date picker and reservation form on the property detail page:\n- **Check-in input**: HTML `<input type=\"date\">` with min=today\n- **Check-out input**: HTML `<input type=\"date\">` with min=check-in or today\n- **Guests selector**: `<select>` dropdown (1 to property.max_guests)\n- **Price calculation**:\n  - Nights calculation: `Math.round((new Date(checkOut) - new Date(checkIn)) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24))`\n  - Nightly total: `nights * property.price_per_night`\n  - Cleaning fee: `property.cleaning_fee`\n  - Total: `nightlyTotal + cleaningFee`\n- **Reserve button**: Dispatches `createBooking` thunk, redirects to `/trips`\n- Prevents booking own property\n- Shows login prompt if not authenticated\n\n### 6. **BOOKING/AVAILABILITY DATA MODELS**\n\n**Booking Interface** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\ninterface Booking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string       // ISO date string\n  check_out: string      // ISO date string\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string\n  property_city?: string\n  property_country?: string\n  property_image?: string | null\n  has_review?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n**Availability Check**: Backend does real-time overlap checking (lines 31-40 of `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`):\n```sql\nSELECT id FROM bookings\nWHERE property_id = ${property_id}\nAND status IN ('confirmed', 'pending')\nAND check_in < ${check_out}\nAND check_out > ${check_in}\n```\n\n**Property Model** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/propertiesSlice.ts`):\n```typescript\ninterface Property {\n  id: string\n  host_id: string\n  title: string\n  description: string\n  property_type: string\n  price_per_night: number\n  cleaning_fee: number\n  max_guests: number\n  bedrooms: number\n  beds: number\n  bathrooms: number\n  address: string\n  city: string\n  state: string | null\n  country: string\n  latitude: number | null\n  longitude: number | null\n  check_in_time: string    // \"14:00\" format\n  check_out_time: string   // \"10:00\" format\n  is_active: boolean\n  created_at: string\n  updated_at: string\n  main_image?: string | null\n  avg_rating?: number\n  review_count?: number\n  // Detail fields\n  host_name?: string\n  host_avatar?: string | null\n  host_bio?: string | null\n  host_since?: string\n  host_listing_count?: number\n  images?: PropertyImage[]\n  amenities?: Amenity[]\n  reviews?: Review[]\n}\n```\n\n### 7. **HEADER/NAVIGATION WITH SEARCH BAR**\n\n**Sidebar Component:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`\n\nNavigation sidebar (220px wide, collapses to 60px):\n- **Logo**: \"airbnb\" in primary red color\n- **Navigation items** (conditionally shown):\n  - Home (always shown)\n  - My Trips (always shown)\n  - Hosting (only if `is_host === true`)\n  - Profile (always shown)\n- **Logout button** (bottom)\n- Active link highlighting with primary color\n- Collapse/expand toggle button\n\nThe SearchBar is part of the Home page layout, not in the header - it's rendered at the top of the home page content area.\n\n### 8. **REDUX STORE STRUCTURE**\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts`\n\nStore configuration with slices:\n```typescript\n{\n  auth: authSlice              // Current user, login/register/update\n  properties: propertiesSlice  // List of properties with filters & pagination\n  favorites: favoritesSlice    // User's favorite property IDs\n  amenities: amenitiesSlice    // Available amenities list\n  propertyDetail: propertyDetailSlice  // Single property details\n  bookings: bookingsSlice      // User's bookings (as guest)\n  host: hostSlice              // Host's listings, bookings, stats\n  userReviews: userReviewsSlice  // Guest's submitted reviews\n  reviewForm: reviewFormSlice   // Review form state for WriteReview page\n}\n```\n\n### 9. **API/BACKEND FUNCTIONS - SEARCH & BOOKINGS**\n\n**Backend Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Key Functions:**\n\n1. **properties.ts** - Property search and detail\n   - `GET /api/properties` - Search with filters (city, dates, guests, price, rooms, amenities)\n   - `GET /api/properties/:id` - Get single property with images, amenities, reviews, host info\n   - `POST /api/properties` - Create property (host)\n   - `PUT /api/properties/:id` - Update property\n   - `DELETE /api/properties/:id` - Deactivate property\n\n2. **bookings.ts** - Booking management\n   - `POST /api/bookings` - Create booking (checks availability overlap)\n   - `GET /api/bookings?guest_id=` - Get user's bookings\n   - `PUT /api/bookings/:id` - Update booking status\n   - `DELETE /api/bookings/:id` - Delete single booking\n   - `DELETE /api/bookings` - Reset all bookings to seed data\n\n3. **auth.ts** - User authentication\n   - `POST /api/auth` - Login (email only) or Register (email + name)\n\n4. **reviews.ts** - Review management\n   - `GET /api/reviews?guest_id=` - Get reviews submitted by user\n   - `GET /api/reviews?property_id=` - Get reviews for property\n   - `POST /api/reviews` - Submit review (includes: rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value, comment)\n   - `DELETE /api/reviews/:id` - Delete review\n\n5. **amenities.ts** - Amenities list\n   - `GET /api/amenities` - Get all amenities grouped by category\n\n6. **favorites.ts** - Favorites management\n   - `GET /api/favorites?user_id=` - Get user's favorites\n   - `POST /api/favorites` - Add favorite\n   - `DELETE /api/favorites/:propertyId?user_id=` - Remove favorite\n\n7. **users.ts** - User management\n   - `GET /api/users/:id` - Get user profile\n   - `PUT /api/users/:id` - Update user profile\n   - `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` - Become a host\n   - `POST /api/users/:id/reset-host` - Reset host status\n\n8. **host-stats.ts** - Host statistics\n   - `GET /api/host-stats?host_id=` - Get total listings, active bookings, total earnings, average rating, review count\n\n9. **host-listings.ts** - Host's properties\n10. **host-bookings.ts** - Host's incoming bookings\n11. **property-images.ts** - Property image management\n\n### 10. **OVERALL STYLING APPROACH**\n\n**Styling Method:** Tailwind CSS with custom theme variables\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css`\n\nUses:\n- **Tailwind CSS** (`@import \"tailwindcss\"`)\n- **CSS custom properties (variables)** for theming:\n  - `--color-primary: #FF5A5F` (Airbnb red)\n  - `--color-primary-dark: #E04E52`\n  - `--color-primary-light: #FF787C`\n  - `--color-bg: #FFFFFF`\n  - `--color-bg-secondary: #F7F7F7`\n  - `--color-text: #222222`\n  - `--color-text-secondary: #717171`\n  - `--color-border: #DDDDDD`\n  - Status colors: pending, confirmed, cancelled, completed\n\n**Component Styling:** All components use Tailwind utility classes with class name strings like:\n```tsx\nclassName=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors\"\n```\n\n**Layout:**\n- Flexbox-based layouts\n- Grid for property listings (responsive: 1 col mobile, 2 sm, 3 lg, 4 xl)\n- Sticky positioning for sidebars and booking cards\n- Responsive design with Tailwind breakpoints (max-sm, md, lg, xl)\n\n### 11. **REDUX THUNKS - ASYNC OPERATIONS**\n\nKey Redux async thunks:\n- `propertiesSlice.fetchProperties()` - Search/fetch properties with filters\n- `propertyDetailSlice.fetchPropertyDetail()` - Get single property\n- `bookingsSlice.createBooking()` - Create a booking\n- `bookingsSlice.fetchUserBookings()` - Get user's bookings\n- `bookingsSlice.cancelBooking()` - Cancel a booking\n- `favoritesSlice.fetchFavorites()`, `addFavorite()`, `removeFavorite()`\n- `amenitiesSlice.fetchAmenities()` - Get amenities list\n- `authSlice.loginUser()`, `registerUser()`, `updateUser()`, `becomeHost()`\n- `hostSlice.fetchHostStats()`, `fetchHostListings()`, `fetchHostBookings()`\n- `userReviewsSlice.fetchUserReviews()`\n- `reviewFormSlice.fetchBookingForReview()`, `submitReview()`\n\n### 12. **KEY COMPONENT INTERACTIONS**\n\n- **Home page** → Search → Filters properties via Redux → Updates URL params → Displays PropertyGrid\n- **PropertyCard** → Click → Navigate to `/properties/:id`\n- **PropertyDetail** → BookingCard → Select dates → Reserve → Create booking → Redirect to `/trips`\n- **MyTrips** → Shows user's bookings (pending, confirmed, completed, cancelled tabs)\n- **HostDashboard** → Shows host stats, listings, and incoming bookings\n- **WriteReview** → Submit review with 5 rating categories + overall comment\n\n### 13. **DATA FLOW SUMMARY**\n\n1. **Search**: User enters filters in SearchBar → `setFilters()` → Redux fetches properties → PropertyGrid renders cards\n2. **Booking**: User selects dates in BookingCard → `createBooking()` thunk → Backend checks availability → Creates booking → Redirects to trips\n3. **Reviews**: Completed booking → Can write review → `submitReview()` thunk → Stored in database → Displayed on property detail\n4. **Host Management**: Host can create listings, manage bookings, view stats, activate/deactivate properties\n\nAll files are located in:\n- Frontend: `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/`\n- Backend: `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`"}],"totalDurationMs":58425,"totalTokens":76391,"totalToolUseCount":40,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4080,"cache_read_input_tokens":68053,"output_tokens":4252,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4080},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
